63
00:03:21.773 --> 00:03:25.830
I think the island fever had set in about week three.

64
00:03:25.830 --> 00:03:28.300
I was starting to get itchy and antsy

65
00:03:28.300 --> 00:03:32.160
and feeling disconnected from people

66
00:03:32.160 --> 00:03:37.160
and the universe and scratch the itch to try this thing out

67
