70
00:03:42.230 --> 00:03:44.650
I think it's also really profound

71
00:03:44.650 --> 00:03:49.650
that the spiritual energy of Kauai is within this podcast.

72
00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:54.690
It is the energy that

73
