1624
01:15:40.270 --> 01:15:41.810
The second being this Book of Hope,

1625
01:15:41.810 --> 01:15:45.960
which is about Jane Goodall's life through the lens of hope

1626
01:15:45.960 --> 01:15:50.600
and her fidelity to this idea of hope,

1627
01:15:50.600 --> 01:15:53.100
