1638
01:16:15.360 --> 01:16:17.660
The second is "The Proof is in the Plants"

1639
01:16:17.660 --> 01:16:19.750
by my buddy Simon Hill.
Simon.

1640
01:16:19.750 --> 01:16:23.790
Simon is the host of The Plant Proof Podcast.

