1658
01:17:16.827 --> 01:17:18.440
"The Proof is in the Plants",

1659
01:17:18.440 --> 01:17:20.750
which is a very plant centric plant forward,

1660
01:17:20.750 --> 01:17:24.870
take on why we should be eating more plants in our diet

1661
01:17:24.870 --> 01:17:27.950
without getting into jingoistic,

1662
01:17:27.950 --> 01:17:31.030
